# Mochi Postres Japoneses - Environment Variables
# 
# This project uses Angular's environment.ts for Supabase credentials.
# Copy src/environments/environment.ts.example to src/environments/environment.ts
# and fill in your Supabase credentials.
#
# The .env file is no longer used for Supabase configuration.
# Credentials are now in:
#   - src/environments/environment.ts (development)
#   - src/environments/environment.prod.ts (production)
